            <ArticleTitle>A clinical Trial of Tofranil in osteo-arthritis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>20-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Animal experiments and uncontrolled clinical experience indicate that imipramine should relieve pain or enhance the effect of analgesics in osteoarthritis. A double-blind crossover trial using Tofranil 25 mg three times daily and matching placebo has, therefore, been designed and initiated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
